# Generated splat cloud built from a 3DGS .ply by scripts/model-to-points.mjs.
# Kept out of git history; the hero falls back to mahjong-points.bin if absent.
# Regenerate from the capture in assets/captures (see the README there):
#   node scripts/model-to-points.mjs assets/captures/splat_clean.ply public/models/mahjong-points.bin 150000 --up z
# The capture itself (~9MB) is tracked. If that gets heavy, move it to Git LFS or
# asset storage rather than deleting it — it is the only source for this cloud.
/public/models/*-splats.bin
